{"title":"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the triangle with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> and circumradius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/5478099bcd3863bae28c44c61c856103811a42b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(b+c) = a\\sqrt{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"22\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ec88ea4915b615215c47202afe325adabd74914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R = \\tfrac{a\\sqrt{bc}}{b+c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"70\" height=\"26\" />.  We can substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> into the area formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/2/da23ab78a058ba2c1c929fdbbe4e43171c7b6ae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\tfrac{abc}{4R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"59\" height=\"21\" /> to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/8/cd8dbf5ed45e75c645cd30257f8fd83f73dd8f59.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} A &amp;= \\frac{abc}{4 \\cdot \\tfrac{a\\sqrt{bc}}{b+c} } \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{abc}{4a\\sqrt{bc}} \\cdot (b+c) \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{(b+c)\\sqrt{bc}}{4}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"155\" height=\"146\" />\nWe also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c14233804834285f7e004be6a5f3c9a559514a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\tfrac{1}{2}bc \\sin(\\theta)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"111\" height=\"21\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the angle between sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/201a2eef545643b50b07fed5c09e894bcced5c58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c.$\" width=\"11\" height=\"8\" />  Substituting this yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/c/04ca9d27272ecd68e4b4607566d5cb640247c7af.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\tfrac{1}{2}bc \\sin(\\theta) &amp;= \\frac{(b+c)\\sqrt{bc}}{4} \\\\ 2\\sqrt{bc} \\cdot \\sin(\\theta) &amp;= b+c \\\\ \\sin(\\theta) &amp;= \\frac{b+c}{2\\sqrt{bc}} \\end{align*}\" width=\"207\" height=\"120\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is inside a triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f22fc10dc1549a06015ad8f4ccb25ee0523bae12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; \\sin{\\theta} \\le 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />.  Substitution yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa143e07b0b2d8917f65be9671d66ed8e8699092.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 &lt; \\frac{b+c}{2\\sqrt{bc}} \\le 1.\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"42\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49cee6e93f8b0668fc5234d5a236338e4a0aef35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" /> is positive, so multiplying both sides by that value would not change the inequality sign.  This means\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f5659187cab6553ca0b3887bc4b05cf9cd5f7f0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 &lt; b+c \\le 2\\sqrt{bc}.\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" />\nHowever, by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AM-GM_Inequality\" title=\"AM-GM Inequality\">AM-GM Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4ee8569eb1168cce7224bee26923d41262e58c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c \\ge 2\\sqrt{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />.  Thus, the equality case must hold, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e3494065b237daa79bb6ecedafbf0bb28d5812bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/8/af85250f10d9ade7477e489fc02f49fb0693dc48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b, c &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />.  When plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e3494065b237daa79bb6ecedafbf0bb28d5812bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, the inequality holds, so the value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebda5306c70a24c574ef0107ed5b5152b5f594cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> truly satisfies all conditions.\n</p><p><br />\nThat means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/997e16ecb1ba569f33d1024d09fed2eaad5ea4a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(\\theta) = \\frac{2b}{2\\sqrt{b^2}} = 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"150\" height=\"42\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ceaed0c977c41272d8bbad7569ca31772a076ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = 90^\\circ.$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />  That means the only truangle that satisfies all the conditions is a 45-45-90 triangle where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is the longest side.  In other words, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cdcae93b440c42e095de117866b3bdc17dbf478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c) \\rightarrow \\boxed{(n\\sqrt{2},n,n)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"183\" height=\"33\" /> for all positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd923e41635af40a1abe58f230732f2280b0723a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO\" title=\"1997 JBMO\">1997 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a><b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190647\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 180/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 912/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 40/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5249/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.619      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%    6.619      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15704:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190647 and revision id 271491. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}